=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span style=\"color:#000\">order</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">terms </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span></span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span></div></code></div>in plot_model that does this, but it does not seem to work on plot_models?</div><div><br></div><div>Could anyone please help? Thanks a lot in advance!</div><div><br></div><div><br></div></div>"
